<thomas.abraham@linaro.org> wrote:
> On 25 April 2013 05:03, Olof Johansson <olof@lixom.net> wrote:
>> On Thu, Dec 13, 2012 at 06:36:18PM +0530, Thomas Abraham wrote:
>>> Add pinctrl device nodes for Exynos5250 SoC.
>>>
